tool.liquify.name = Yenza kube uketshezi
tool.liquify.description = Phusha, zungezisa, shwabanisa noma khukhumalisa amaphikseli ngaphansi kwebhulashi elikhulu — inketho yemodi ikhetha isenzo esenziwayo. Ukusonteka kuqoqeka kumeshi bese kusetshenziswa engqimbeni lapho kuqinisekiswa.
